      "created_at": "2017-04-16T11:00:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I use standard Mayday sleeves. I regularly buy them in batches of 50 packs, think I'm on batch 4 or 5 right now. I use them for pretty much every game, except for trading card games like Magic. I started sleeving after having to replace some games due to really bad sweat damage by someone and with&nbsp;dozens of people having access to my games I need to protect them from getting worn down.</p>",
